      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "This updates LKMini’s centralization-tracking metadata to reflect the public/open-source protection rules, and refreshes the repository’s Mini SHA256 records to match the current seed state. It also records the provided canonical `Root256` as part of the lineage/identity metadata.\n\n- **Public repo centralization tracking**\n  - Extended `/home/runner/work/welcome/welcome/LOCATOR.json` with `public_repo_protection` metadata.\n  - Marks this repository as:\n    - `public`\n    - `open_source: true`\n    - `archived: false`\n    - `default_branch: main`\n    - `migration_action: locator_only`\n  - Records the back-reference target for centralization tracking without implying content migration of this public seed.\n\n- **Mini SHA256 refresh**\n  - Updated `/home/runner/work/welcome/welcome/SHA256SUMS` so the tracked hashes match the current LKMini seed files.\n  - Added the provided canonical identity hash as `ROOT256`.\n\n- **Lineage identity metadata**\n  - Added `ROOT256` to `/home/runner/work/welcome/welcome/LINEAGE.md` so the repo’s identity root is explicitly recorded alongside the existing root constants.\n\nExample of the new recorded metadata:\n\n```json\n\"public_repo_protection\": {\n  \"tracked_by\": \"CentralizationTracker\",\n  \"visibility\": \"public\",\n  \"open_source\": true,\n  \"archived\": false,\n  \"default_branch\": \"main\",\n  \"migration_action\": \"locator_only\",\n  \"migration_target_repo\": \"ky46738-ops/lk-unique-gate\",\n  \"migration_target_issue\": 3,\n  \"acceptance_status\": \"PASS\"\n}\n```\n\n```text\nROOT256=6c0f6f487d8af27de4a8cee9f3fc853f0fbcf417cbd21acb56ac65c55adfcf34\n```",
