      "merged_at": "2026-07-06T22:58:10Z"
    },
    "body": "This PR brings the public `ky46738-ops/tiny-state-core` project into this repository as a standalone copy, preserving runtime behavior while localizing user-facing text to Chinese. The import keeps the MIT-licensed source structure intact and limits changes to documentation, metadata text, and comments.\n\n- **Project import**\n  - Add a new `tiny-state-core/` directory containing the upstream public project files:\n    - `README.md`\n    - `package.json`\n    - `core.js`\n    - `core.min.js`\n    - `test.js`\n\n- **Chinese localization**\n  - Translate `README.md` to Chinese\n  - Translate `package.json` `description` to Chinese\n  - Translate comments in `core.js` to Chinese\n  - Translate comments in `test.js` to Chinese\n\n- **Behavior preservation**\n  - Keep JavaScript logic unchanged in `core.js`\n  - Keep `core.min.js` byte-for-byte equivalent to the imported minified source\n  - Preserve package name, entrypoint, script contract, and test semantics\n\n- **Imported usage surface**\n  ```js\n  import { createCore } from './core.js'\n\n  const c = createCore({ count: 0 })\n  c.on('change', (state) => console.log(state))\n  c.set({ count: 1 })\n  c.destroy()\n  ```",
